Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:17.64,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Hi everyone, thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.16,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,It's great to have you here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:24.08,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Today I'm going to talk about three things, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:27.92,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,We will start with why it's so important to us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:31.36,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,to have a product that we can make freely available
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:33.52,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and broadly available to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.15,0:00:38.24,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And we're always trying to find out ways to reduce friction
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.24,0:00:41.20,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,so everyone can use ChatGPT wherever they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:46.08,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So today, we'll be releasing the desktop version of ChatGPT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:49.92,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and the refreshed UI that makes it simpler to use,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.84,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,much more natural as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:00:56.00,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,But the big news today is that we are launching
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:01:00.96,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,our new flagship model, and we are calling it GPT-4O.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:04.23,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,The special thing about GPT-4O
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:09.12,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,is that it brings GPT-4 level intelligence to everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:11.04,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,including our free users.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:14.16,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,We'll be showing some live demos today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:18.23,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,to show the full extent of the capabilities of our new model,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:22.64,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and we'll be rolling them out iteratively over the next few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:26.08,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Alright, so let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.36,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,A very important part of our mission
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:33.60,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,is to be able to make our advanced AI tools
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:35.68,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,available to everyone for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.04,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,We think it's very, very important
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:43.04,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,that people have an intuitive feel for what the technology can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:47.92,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and so we really want to pair it with this broader understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:52.00,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And we're always finding ways to reduce that friction,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:55.92,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and recently we made ChatGPT available without the signup flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:02:01.84,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And today, we're also bringing the desktop app to ChatGPT
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:05.68,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,because we want you to be able to use it wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:08.63,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,As you can see, it's easy, it's simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:11.91,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,it integrates very, very easily in your workflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:16.56,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Along with it, we have also refreshed the UI.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:21.28,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,We know that these models get more and more complex,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.63,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,but we want the experience of interaction
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:28.24,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,to actually become more natural, easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:31.68,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and for you not to focus on the UI at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:34.72,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,but just focus on the collaboration with ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:38.08,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And now the big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:42.88,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Today, we are releasing our newest flagship model.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:45.12,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,This is GPT-4O.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:56.96,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,GPT-4O provides GPT-4 level intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.56,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,but it is much faster,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:04.64,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and it improves on its capabilities across text, vision, and audio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:07.36,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,For the past couple of years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:11.04,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,we've been very focused on improving the intelligence of these models,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:13.12,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and they've gotten pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:15.84,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,But this is the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:18.64,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,that we are really making a huge step forward
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.56,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,when it comes to the ease of use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.56,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And this is incredibly important
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:27.44,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,because we're looking at the future of interaction
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:30.24,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,between ourselves and the machines,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:32.96,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and we think that GPT-4O
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:38.08,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,is really shifting that paradigm into the future of collaboration,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:42.72,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,where this interaction becomes much more natural and far, far easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:47.44,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,But you know, making this happen is actually quite complex
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:49.84,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,because when we interact with one another,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:52.64,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,there's a lot of stuff that we take for granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:57.28,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,You know, the ease of our dialogue when we interrupt one another,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.28,0:04:02.08,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,the background noises, the multiple voices in a conversation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:05.84,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,or you know, understanding the tone of voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:10.40,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,All of these things are actually quite complex for these models.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:14.16,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And until now, with voice mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:18.72,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,we had three models that come together to deliver this experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:23.20,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,We have transcription, intelligence, and then text to speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:27.12,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,All comes together in orchestration to deliver voice mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:32.39,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,This also brings a lot of latency to the experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.39,0:04:37.04,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and it really breaks that immersion in the collaboration with ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:42.16,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,But now, with GPT-4O, this all happens natively.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.95,0:04:48.80,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,GPT-4O reasons across voice, text, and vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:52.64,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And with these incredible efficiencies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:57.92,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,it also allows us to bring the GPT-4 class intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:04:59.36,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,to our free users.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:03.52,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,This is something that we've been trying to do for many, many months,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:08.32,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and we're very, very excited to finally bring GPT-4O
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:09.83,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,to all of our users.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:16.64,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Today, we have 100 million people, more than 100 million in fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:21.12,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,they use ChatGPT to create, work, learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:25.60,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And we have these advanced tools
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:30.40,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,that are only available to our paid users, at least until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:35.20,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,With the efficiencies of 4O, we can bring these tools to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:41.12,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So starting today, you can use GPTs and the GPT store.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:45.68,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So far, we've had more than a million users
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:48.96,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,create amazing experiences with GPTs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:52.24,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,These are custom ChatGPTs for specific use cases
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:54.00,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,that are available in the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:58.08,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And now, our builders have a much bigger audience,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:02.64,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,where you know, university professors can create content for their students,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:06.56,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,or podcasters can create content for their listeners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:10.88,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And you can also use vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:16.88,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So now you can upload screenshots, photos, documents
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:19.36,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,containing both text and images,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:24.72,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and you can start conversations with ChatGPT about all of this content.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:26.64,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,You can also use memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:30.40,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,where it makes ChatGPT far more useful and helpful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:35.12,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,because now it has a sense of continuity across all your conversations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:40.16,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And you can use browse, where you can search for real-time information
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:41.28,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,in your conversation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:06:45.68,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and advanced data analysis, where you can upload charts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:50.96,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,or any information, and it will analyze this information,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:53.28,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,it will give you answers, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:07:00.80,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Lastly, we've also improved on the quality and speed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:05.12,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,in 50 different languages for ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:06.88,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And this is very, very important
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:09.84,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,because we want to be able to bring this experience
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:12.24,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,to as many people out there as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.52,0:07:17.52,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So we're very, very excited to bring GPT-4O
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:20.24,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,to all of our free users out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:23.28,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and for the paid users, they will continue to have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:28.08,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,up to five times the capacity limits of our free users.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:33.84,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,But GPT-4O is not only available in ChatGPT,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:36.16,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,we're also bringing it to the API.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:47.60,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So our developers can start building today with GPT-4O
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.60,0:07:51.68,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and making amazing AI applications, deploying them at scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:56.96,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,4O is available at 2X faster, 50% cheaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:08:01.04,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and five times higher rate limits compared to GPT-4 Turbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.84,0:08:08.56,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,But you know, as we bring these technologies into the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:11.68,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,it's quite challenging to figure out how to do so
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:16.16,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,in a way that's both useful and also safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:21.76,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And GPT-4O presents new challenges for us when it comes to safety
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:25.92,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,because we're dealing with real-time audio, real-time vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:30.00,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And our team has been hard at work figuring out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:33.67,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,how to build mitigations against misuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:38.40,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,We continue to work with different stakeholders out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:41.76,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,from government, media, entertainment, all industries,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:44.96,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,red teamers, civil society,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:49.28,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,to figure out how to best bring these technologies into the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:51.44,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So over the next few weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:54.00,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,we'll continue our iterative deployment
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:56.64,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,to bring out all the capabilities to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:09:01.12,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,But today, I want to show you all these capabilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:03.52,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,so we'll do some live demos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:07.28,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,I will bring on two of our research leads,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:10.72,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Mike Chen and Barrett Zhou, to join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:20.00,Default,Speaker 2,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Barrett.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.32,0:09:21.12,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:25.04,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So one of the key capabilities we're really excited to share with you today
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:27.12,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,is real-time conversational speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:28.88,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Let's just get a demo fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:30.88,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So I'm taking out a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:34.72,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,If you are wondering about this wired so we have consistent internet,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:38.16,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and if you see, there's this little icon on the bottom right
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:39.36,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,of the ChatGPT app,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:42.79,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and this will open up GPT-4O's audio capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:47.52,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Hey, ChatGPT, I'm Mark. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:52.96,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Oh, Mark, I'm doing great. Thanks for asking. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:56.40,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Hey, so I'm on stage right now, I'm doing a live demo,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:58.32,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and frankly, I'm feeling a little bit nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:10:00.08,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Can you help me calm my nerves a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:03.52,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Oh, you're doing a live demo right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.67,0:10:06.88,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,That's awesome. Just take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.67,0:10:09.91,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,And remember, you're the expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:13.04,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I like that suggestion. Let me try a couple of deep breaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:15.04,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Can you give me feedback on my breaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:16.00,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:20.08,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Whoa, slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:23.52,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,A bit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.40,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Mark, you're not a vacuum cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:29.67,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Breathe in for a count of four.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:31.84,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, let me try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:35.52,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna breathe in deeply, and then breathe out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:40.08,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,For four, and then exhale slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:44.88,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll try again. Breathing in, and breathe out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:48.32,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,That's it. How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:50.24,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I feel a lot better. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:55.36,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So Mark, you've been working on these capabilities for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:58.48,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Can you tell us a bit how it's different from voice mode?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:01.84,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Right, so if you've used our voice mode experience before,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:03.68,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,you'll notice a couple key differences.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.84,0:11:05.76,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,First, you know, you can now interrupt the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:08.48,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,You don't have to wait for it to finish your turn
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:09.92,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,before you can start speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.92,0:11:12.08,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and you know, you can just butt in whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:15.92,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Second, the model is real-time responsiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:19.60,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So that means that you don't have this awkward 2-3 second lag
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:21.68,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,before you wait for the model to give a response.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.96,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,And finally, the model picks up on emotion, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.44,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,When I was breathing super hard there, it could tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:29.76,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and you, hey, you might want to calm down a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:32.40,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,You're kind of running a little bit too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:36.00,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So you know, it really has that capability across the board
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.20,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,to perceive your emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:41.44,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Not only that, though, the model is able to generate voice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:43.52,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,in a variety of different emotive styles,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:45.92,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and it really has a wide dynamic range.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:47.84,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna fire up another demo for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:48.48,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:54.24,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Hey, ChatGPT, how are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:58.08,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,I'm doing fantastic. Thanks for asking. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:11:58.80,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:11:59.36,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:02.72,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So my friend Barrett here, he's been having trouble sleeping lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:06.32,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and I want you to tell him a bedtime story about robots and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.96,0:12:10.72,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Oh, a bedtime story about robots and love?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:12.32,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,I got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:14.24,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Gather round, Barrett.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:18.24,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, in a world not too different from ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.48,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,there was a robot named Byte.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:23.68,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Byte was a curious robot, always exploring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:27.36,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I want a little bit more emotion in your voice, a little bit more drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:30.72,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Got it. Let's add some drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:35.12,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, in a world not too different from ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:36.88,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,there was a robot named Byte.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:39.04,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,No, no, no, ChatGPT, I really want maximal emotion,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:41.92,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,like maximal expressiveness, much more than you were doing before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:46.08,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Understood. Let's amplify the drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:51.20,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, in a world not too different from ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:53.92,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,there was a robot named Byte.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:57.20,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Can you do this in a robotic voice now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:13:01.12,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Initiating dramatic robotic voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:06.24,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, in a world not too different from ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:08.80,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,there was a robot named Byte.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:13.44,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Byte was a curious robot, always exploring new circuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:14.88,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Barrett here, calm down a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:17.92,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Can you end the story, but do it in a singing voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:24.64,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,And so Byte found another robot friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:28.88,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,and they lived circuitly ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.16,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:32.56,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I definitely feel a lot more relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:41.36,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,You've just seen the voice capabilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:44.08,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,but we also want to show you the vision capabilities
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:47.04,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,as the model can also see the whole world around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.36,0:13:48.64,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Yeah, absolutely. Like, as you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:50.80,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,you know, you can chat with ChatGPT in real time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:53.84,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,but you can also interact with it with video as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:57.52,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, so let me boot up ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:00.48,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Hey, ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:03.84,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Hello there, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.64,0:14:05.60,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,It's going really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:07.92,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Today, I'd really like your help solving a math problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:12.16,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,I'm all ears. What math problem can I help you tackle today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:14.72,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna write down a linear equation on a sheet of paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:16.96,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and I'll show you, and then I'd love your help working me through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.12,0:14:18.88,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,But importantly, don't tell me the solution,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:20.16,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,just help give me hints along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:22.08,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.68,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Okay, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:29.92,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,No, I didn't show you yet. Just give me help along the way. One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:35.84,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Whoops, I got too excited. I'm ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:49.28,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So, ChatGPT, what equation did I write down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:52.64,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Ah, I see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:56.64,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,You wrote down 3X plus 1 equals 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:15:00.32,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Yep, exactly. So what's the first step I should take to try to solve this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:05.76,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,The first step is to get all the terms with X on one side
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:07.60,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,and the constants on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:10.32,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,So what do you think we should do with that plus 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:12.96,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm gonna try to subtract 1 from both sides,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:13.84,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and then I'll see what I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.28,0:15:16.32,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.44,0:15:21.60,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Perfect. Now, what do you get when you subtract 1 from both sides?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:29.92,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, so ChatGPT, this is what I ended up with. How does this look?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:35.04,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Spot on. Now you've isolated the term with X on one side,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:37.60,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,and it looks like 3X equals 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:40.64,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,What do you think we should do next to solve for X?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.12,0:15:42.56,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. Can you give me another hint?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.84,0:15:49.12,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Of course. You have 3X, and you want to find the value of X.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:52.48,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Think about what operation would undo multiplication.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:53.84,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Is it subtraction?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:58.00,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Close, but think of the opposite of multiplication
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:16:01.36,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,because 3X means 3 times X.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:04.80,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, I think it's division. Let me try to divide both sides by 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:05.68,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and let me see what I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:09.44,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Bingo. Go ahead and divide both sides by 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.36,0:16:18.72,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, so ChatGPT, this is what I ended up with. How does this look?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:23.84,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,It looks perfect. You've solved it, and X equals 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:27.84,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Nicely done. How do you feel about solving linear equations now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:32.64,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Yeah, honestly, I'm not pretty confident I can solve linear equations,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:34.88,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,but why would you ever need to use this in the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:36.24,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I'm really skeptical.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.56,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,That's a fair question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:42.40,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Linear equations pop up in a lot of everyday situations,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.00,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,even if we don't realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.16,0:16:47.84,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,For example, calculating expenses, planning travel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.08,0:16:51.76,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,cooking, and even in business for profit and loss calculations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:54.24,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,It's basically a way to solve problems
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:57.68,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,where you need to find an unknown value. Plus, it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:16:59.84,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,You know, I have a lot of unknown values in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:03.36,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I'm totally convinced I'm gonna learn math now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:07.68,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,I love that attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:11.35,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Math can definitely help solve some of life's mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.35,0:17:14.40,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Whenever you're ready to dive into more math, I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:16.48,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Anything else you'd like to tackle today?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:18.64,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So ChatGPT, I really love that you, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:20.48,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,taught the value of math to my friend Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:23.35,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,And I wrote one last thing. I'd love if you could take a look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:26.56,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Of course. I'd love to see what you wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:28.08,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Show it to me whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:30.56,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, so this is what I wrote down. What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:37.68,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. I love ChatGPT. That's so sweet of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:40.32,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I really appreciate all the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:42.88,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So yeah, as we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:50.24,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Wow, that's quite the outfit you've got on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.24,0:17:53.68,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Yeah, as we can see, you know, we can chat in real time to ChatGPT,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.83,0:17:56.56,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and not only that, we can interact with it with video as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.11,0:18:00.48,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,And I swear, like, if you look at Barrett's GPT history,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:01.68,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,it's all equations like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:07.04,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Now that you know you can do linear equations,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.04,0:18:09.11,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,can you show us something more complex?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:12.48,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I think so. Okay, next, let's try something coding related.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:15.68,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So let me take out a computer for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:23.83,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, so I'm gonna open the ChatGPT desktop app
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.44,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,like Mira was talking about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:30.00,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, and to give a bit of background of what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:33.44,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,so here we have a computer, and on the screen we have some code.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:35.59,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,And then the ChatGPT voice app is on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:39.35,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So ChatGPT will be able to hear me, but it can't see anything on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:42.08,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna highlight the code, Command-C it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:43.59,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and then that will send it to ChatGPT,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.59,0:18:45.44,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and then I'm gonna talk about the code to ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:47.83,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Hey, ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:50.64,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Hey there, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.11,0:18:52.00,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's going really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:54.56,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you could help me with a coding problem today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.28,0:18:57.68,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Of course. I'd love to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:18:59.44,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,What's the coding problem you're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.83,0:19:02.16,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm gonna share with you some code. One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:04.48,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Sure thing. Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:09.92,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, so I just shared some code with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:12.00,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Could you give me a really brief one-sentence description
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:13.04,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,of what's going on in the code?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:16.16,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,This code fetches daily weather data
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:18.64,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,for a specific location and time period,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:21.76,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,smoothes the temperature data using a rolling average,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:25.28,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,annotates a significant weather event on the resulting plot,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:28.24,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,and then displays the plot with the average, minimum,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:30.40,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,and maximum temperatures over the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.11,0:19:32.24,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Awesome. Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:34.48,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,And in the code, there's this function foo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.64,0:19:36.32,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Could you describe to me what the plot would look like
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:38.24,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,if I had versus didn't have this function?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:42.24,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Sure. The function foo X, Y
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:45.76,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,takes in a data frame X containing temperature data
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:49.59,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,and a window size Y for calculating the rolling mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:53.52,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,It smoothes the average temperature, minimum temperature,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:55.68,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,and maximum temperature columns
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:59.04,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,by applying a rolling mean over the specified window.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:00.88,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,With the foo function,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:03.83,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,the plot would show smoother temperature lines
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:08.48,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,because the rolling mean reduces the noise or fluctuations in the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:10.24,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Awesome. Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.24,0:20:12.24,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So yeah, I definitely will want to apply this function,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.32,0:20:14.96,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and so I'm gonna generate the plot and then show it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:15.83,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Give me one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.11,0:20:18.88,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Absolutely. Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:20.80,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,I'm excited to see the plot when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.11,0:20:24.40,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Yeah, so so far, ChatGPT has only been able to see the code,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.48,0:20:26.16,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and now I'm gonna run it, and then I'll use
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:28.80,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,the vision capabilities of the ChatGPT desktop app
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:31.04,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,so it can actually see everything going on on the screen as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:40.96,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, ChatGPT, I'm sharing with you the plot now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:42.48,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I'm wondering if you can give me a really brief
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:44.08,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,one-sentence overview of what you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:48.80,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,The plot displays smoothed average, minimum,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:52.00,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,and maximum temperatures throughout 2018
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.16,0:20:56.64,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,with a notable annotation marking a big rainfall event in late September.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.83,0:20:59.44,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Fantastic. I have another question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:02.00,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Which months do you see the hottest temperatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:04.16,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,And roughly what temperatures do those correspond to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:09.44,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,The hottest temperatures occur around July and August.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:12.08,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,The maximum temperature during these months
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:15.83,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,is roughly between 25 degrees and 30 degrees,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:19.92,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,77 degrees Fahrenheit to 86 degrees Fahrenheit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:25.11,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,What's going on with the Y axis? Is this in Celsius or Fahrenheit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:28.00,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,The Y axis is in Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:30.24,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,The temperatures are labeled accordingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.24,0:21:34.56,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,such as average temperature, minimum temperature, and maximum temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:38.00,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Yeah, so as we can see, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:42.16,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,not only can ChatGPT help me solve very easy linear algebra equations
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:43.04,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,that I need help with,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:45.20,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,it can also interact with, you know, code bases
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:48.24,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and see the outputs of plots and everything like this going on on a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:57.68,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So a few minutes ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.68,0:22:01.28,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,we asked the live audience on X to submit few requests
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:03.36,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,for what they would like us to try out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:06.00,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So I will take a couple of prompts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.16,0:22:11.84,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Okay, BotGascar wants to know
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.84,0:22:15.44,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,if GPT-4O is capable of real-time translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.16,0:22:17.44,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Mark, you wanna try this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:18.56,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Sure, yeah, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.56,0:22:21.92,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,I speak Italian, so we can just do English-Italian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:23.84,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Try to do English-Italian. Sure, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.32,0:22:27.84,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Hey, ChatGPT, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.64,0:22:31.84,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,I'm doing fantastic. Thanks for asking. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.84,0:22:32.88,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,How's your day going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.88,0:22:35.84,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I'm doing great. So I would like you to function as a translator.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:37.92,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,I have a friend here who only speaks Italian,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.08,0:22:39.52,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and I only speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.60,0:22:42.88,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,And every time you hear English, I want you to translate it to Italian,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:45.36,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and if you hear Italian, I want you to translate it back to English.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:45.92,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Is that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.04,0:22:47.84,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Perfetto.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.80,0:22:56.00,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Mike, io mi chiedo se le ballene potessero parlare, cosa ci direbbero?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.96,0:23:01.20,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Mike, she wonders if whales could talk, what would they tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.88,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,They might ask, how do we solve linear equations?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.16,0:23:12.00,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Potrebbero chiederci come risolviamo le equazioni lineari?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:14.24,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Sicuramente sì.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.64,0:23:17.60,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Certainly yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.24,0:23:19.60,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Great, looks like it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.28,0:23:29.52,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,All right, so the next one is from BuritoJohn78,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.52,0:23:34.56,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,who asks, can you tell what you're feeling just by looking at your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:36.88,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Barrett, you wanna give this one a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:38.24,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Absolutely, let's try it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.84,0:23:42.72,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Hey, ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.08,0:23:45.60,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Hey there, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.76,0:23:47.04,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,How can I brighten your day today?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.20,0:23:50.08,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, yeah, so I'm gonna show you a selfie of what I look like,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.08,0:23:52.64,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,and then I'd like you to try to see what emotions I'm feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:53.52,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,based on how I'm looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.40,0:23:55.84,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Sounds like a fun challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:57.76,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Go ahead and show me that selfie,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.84,0:24:00.56,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,and I'll put my emotional detective hat on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:02.88,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, so here's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.88,0:24:04.88,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,So what kind of emotions do you think I'm feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.72,0:24:10.24,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Hmm, it seems like I'm looking at a picture of a wooden surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.24,0:24:12.48,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Oh, you know what? That was the thing I sent you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.48,0:24:14.24,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm not actually a table.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:16.24,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Okay, so take another look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.96,0:24:18.80,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Ah, that makes more sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.04,0:24:22.80,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Ah, there we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.04,0:24:26.24,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,It looks like you're feeling pretty happy and cheerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:29.52,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,with a big smile and maybe even a touch of excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.00,0:24:32.96,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Whatever's going on, it seems like you're in a great mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.60,0:24:35.52,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Care to share the source of those good vibes?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.76,0:24:37.36,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,Yeah, no, the reason I'm in a really good mood
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.36,0:24:39.28,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,is because we were doing a presentation showcasing
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.28,0:24:40.64,Default,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,how useful and amazing you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.48,0:24:45.12,Default,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Oh, stop it. You're making me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.44,0:24:52.96,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Amazing. Well, that's it for today on live demos.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:57.28,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,As you can see, this is, this just feels so magical,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.28,0:24:59.84,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and that's wonderful, but we also want to
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.00,0:25:03.04,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,remove some of the mysticism from the technology
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.04,0:25:05.92,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and bring it to you so you can try it for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.92,0:25:10.32,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So over the next few weeks, we'll be rolling out these capabilities to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.88,0:25:14.08,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Today has been very much focused on the free users
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:16.48,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and the new modalities and new products,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.56,0:25:19.68,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,but we also care a lot about the next frontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.24,0:25:23.60,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,So soon, we'll be updating you on our progress
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.60,0:25:25.28,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,towards the next big thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.32,0:25:27.84,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And before we wrap up,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.84,0:25:30.88,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,I just want to thank the incredible OpenAI team,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.28,0:25:34.24,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,and also thanks to Jensen and the Nvidia team
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.24,0:25:38.56,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,for bringing us the most advanced GPUs to make this demo possible today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.04,0:25:42.88,Default,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,And thank you all very, very much for being a part of this today.
